### 2 — Database (SQLite Migration v14)

#### [MODIFY] [database_helper.dart](file:///Users/mehmetaliisik/Desktop/lessontracker/app/lib/core/database/database_helper.dart)

`version: 13` → `version: 14` olarak arttırılır. [_onCreate](file:///Users/mehmetaliisik/Desktop/lessontracker/app/lib/core/database/database_helper.dart#60-221) ve [_onUpgrade](file:///Users/mehmetaliisik/Desktop/lessontracker/app/lib/core/database/database_helper.dart#222-424) (if oldVersion < 14) bloğuna 2 yeni tablo eklenir:

```sql
-- Moodle hesap bilgileri (token hariç — token SecureStorage'da)
CREATE TABLE moodle_accounts (
  id          TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
  baseUrl     TEXT NOT NULL,
  siteTitle   TEXT NOT NULL,
  username    TEXT NOT NULL,
  fullName    TEXT NOT NULL,
  avatarUrl   TEXT,
  lastSynced  TEXT NOT NULL,
  isActive    INTEGER DEFAULT 1
);

-- Moodle önbelleği (JSON olarak ham API yanıtları)
CREATE TABLE moodle_cache (
  id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  accountId   TEXT NOT NULL,
  dataType    TEXT NOT NULL,   -- 'courses' | 'assignments' | 'grades' | 'announcements' | 'events'
  payload     TEXT NOT NULL,   -- JSON
  cachedAt    TEXT NOT NULL,
  FOREIGN KEY (accountId) REFERENCES moodle_accounts(id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);
CREATE INDEX idx_moodle_cache_account ON moodle_cache (accountId, dataType);
```

> **Rollback**: DB version'ı 13'e döndür ve iki yeni tabloyu drop et — başka hiçbir şey değişmez.

